      en: ["Home to a major Russian air force base.", "Named after the German philosopher Immanuel Kant.", "Was formerly a hub for Kyrgyzstan's German minority.", "Features a large cement factory and food processing plants.", "Located only about 20 km east of the capital, Bishkek.", "Considered one of the most industrially developed small towns.", "The region is known for sugar beet cultivation."]
