      en: ["A well-known centre for winter sports with a modern ski resort.", "Founded in 1910 by Russian settlers in the Chuy Valley.", "Was a site for processing rare earth elements during the Soviet era.", "Officially attained city status only in 2012.", "Located on the northern slopes of the Kyrgyz Range.", "Economy is driven by mining and growing tourism.", "The town benefits from its close proximity to the capital, Bishkek."]
